[h1]Spy Repeat[/h1]
[b]Preview 0.1.0 · Single-player only · Not verified in-game[/b]

Repeat assigned spy missions and counterspy duties. Pause when intervention is needed.

[h2]How to use[/h2]
Assign a mission manually, open the Spy Repeat list, then enable it for that spy. Promotions, travel, escape and invalid targets require intervention.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
The target setup is Gathering Storm with Harmony in Diversity. Real-game, save/load and current HD compatibility have not been verified. Multiplayer and hotseat are unsupported. Avoid assigning the same objects to another automation mod.

[h2]Feedback[/h2]
Include game/DLC/HD versions, enabled mods, reproduction steps and relevant Lua.log or Modding.log errors.

